@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/[reaction_uuid]
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceMessageReactionController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "索引式公众展示\n+ 外键的物理行" as DB
Client -> API: GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/message_reactions/{reaction_uuid}
API -> DB: reaction_uuid + 适用 placement;\njoin active stream membership + generation
DB --> API: 没有计算的行
API --> Client: 200, 公开的 JSON
note over API,DB
没有记录 / transactional outbox / 任务 / 背景表演者 / 事件
没有集成或恢复在查询时
Public message_uuid = placement UUID; 恢复方法 placement context
为了 reaction_uuid 仍然是集中式的 OPEN-根据.
end note
@enduml
